### ============================================
### ORDER SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/order-item-modifiers
@modifierId = 1
@orderItemId = 1


### Create a new modifier
### Request Body: BookingDto
### Response: Created BookingDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderItemId": "uuid-order-item",
  "modifierName": "Extra Cheese",
  "price": 1.50
}

### Update modifier by ID
### Request Body: BookingDto
### Response: Updated BookingDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{modifierId}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modifierName": "No Onions",
  "price": 0.00
}

### Get modifier by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: BookingDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{modifierId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all modifiers by order item ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<BookingDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/order-item/{{orderItemId}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete modifier by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{{modifierId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
